        "id": 1148215
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-12-17T11:27:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wouldn\u0027t put it in the documentation if it\u0027s not supported yet. But I can do it in a follow-up change. It\u0027s easy enough.",
